@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>E-commerce Catalog</h1>

<p>
    Welcome to the store. <code>Ecommerce.Api</code> persists categories, products and orders
    in <strong>SQLite</strong> using <strong>Entity Framework Core</strong>.
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Open <a href="products">Products</a> to browse and manage the catalog.</li>
    <li>The API and its Swagger UI run at <code>http://localhost:5088/swagger</code>.</li>
</ul>

<p class="text-muted">
    MAUI Blazor Hybrid cannot run on Linux, so this Blazor web host renders the exact
    same shared components that the MAUI client will use on Windows.
</p>
